1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:06,433
My name is Grâce Kouassi. I sell fish and attiéké at the Adjamé market

2
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:12,640
in Abidjan. And last year I learned that God stays faithful even when people don't.

3
00:00:13,789 --> 00:00:18,097
For twelve years I've gotten up at four. My husband Koffi drives

4
00:00:18,097 --> 00:00:22,269
a shared taxi. Between the two of us, we keep the house going.

5
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:26,652
My daughter Bénédicte is fourteen and wants to be a doctor.

6
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:30,289
My little Josué is nine. He just wants to play football.

7
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:37,369
Like many women at the market, I was in a tontine, a savings circle. Twelve women. Every

8
00:00:37,369 --> 00:00:43,030
week each puts in ten thousand francs. And every month one of us gets the whole pot.

9
00:00:43,579 --> 00:00:55,000
My turn was in September. Right at back-to-school. Bénédicte's school fees, supplies, uniforms. I had it all worked out.

10
00:00:56,149 --> 00:01:02,003
Auntie Odile kept the money. We sang together in the choir. She held my

11
00:01:02,003 --> 00:01:07,609
Josué on the day of his baptism. I trusted her like an older sister.

12
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:16,010
On the day of my turn, Auntie Odile didn't come. Her phone was off. Her shop was closed.

13
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:25,290
The next day we learned she was gone. With everything. Over a million francs. The money of twelve families.

14
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:30,701
That night I said nothing to the children. I sat in the

15
00:01:30,701 --> 00:01:36,590
living room with Bénédicte's uniform beside me. And I felt the anger rising.

16
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:44,519
Not just over the money. Over the shame. I had trusted. The whole market was going to talk.

17
00:01:45,670 --> 00:01:51,355
A neighbor from the market came to see me. She whispered, Grâce, I know

18
00:01:51,355 --> 00:01:56,480
someone. A marabout. He can make her come back, or make her pay.

19
00:01:57,030 --> 00:02:01,519
I won't lie. For one second, I wanted to say yes.

20
00:02:02,670 --> 00:02:08,664
Dearly beloved, avenge not yourselves, but rather give place unto wrath: for it

21
00:02:08,664 --> 00:02:14,280
is written, Vengeance is mine; I will repay, saith the Lord. Romans 12:19.

22
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:19,774
That night I opened the app my cousin in Paris sent

23
00:02:19,774 --> 00:02:24,969
me. Community Covenant. There's a box that asks, how are you?

24
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:30,326
I wrote, someone stole my children's school money. It was

25
00:02:30,326 --> 00:02:35,639
a sister from church. I want revenge. I don't recognize myself.

26
00:02:36,789 --> 00:02:42,080
Grâce, your anger is real, and God hears it. You don't have to pretend it doesn't hurt.

27
00:02:42,629 --> 00:02:46,470
But don't let this betrayal steal your peace too. Give justice to

28
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:49,719
God, and ask Him for the next step, not the whole road.

29
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:55,624
Bénédicte had heard me crying. She sat down next to

30
00:02:55,624 --> 00:03:00,099
me and said, Mama, I can wait a year. It's okay.

31
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:05,789
It broke my heart. A fourteen-year-old wanting to carry her mother's weight.

32
00:03:06,939 --> 00:03:11,502
I took her in my arms and said, no, my daughter. That's

33
00:03:11,502 --> 00:03:16,229
not yours to carry. I'll do my part, and God will do His.

34
00:03:17,379 --> 00:03:24,639
On Sunday I went to see Pastor Yao. I thought he'd tell me to forgive right away and forget everything.

35
00:03:25,189 --> 00:03:31,118
Grâce, forgiving doesn't mean saying it was nothing. It means refusing to let

36
00:03:31,118 --> 00:03:36,969
revenge become your job. Judgment belongs to God. Your job is your children.

37
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:43,883
And then he did something I didn't expect. He gathered the eleven women of

38
00:03:43,883 --> 00:03:50,659
the tontine after the service. We prayed together. Not against Odile. For our children.

39
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:57,750
One of us said, if we stay alone, we stay robbed. If we stand together, we start again.

40
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:03,498
On Monday I went to see the school principal. I was ashamed,

41
00:04:03,498 --> 00:04:08,020
but I told the truth. She let me pay in three installments.

42
00:04:09,169 --> 00:04:16,420
I added evenings at the market. Bénédicte came to help after school, with her notebooks on the table between customers.

43
00:04:16,970 --> 00:04:24,019
Commit thy way unto the Lord; trust also in him; and he shall bring it to pass. Psalm 37:5.

44
00:04:25,170 --> 00:04:30,006
Seven months later, Auntie Odile came back. Thin. She said her son

45
00:04:30,006 --> 00:04:35,209
had fallen sick in Bouaké, that she panicked, that she lost everything.

46
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:41,060
She handed me an envelope. It wasn't all of it. But it was a start.

47
00:04:42,209 --> 00:04:47,394
I haven't forgotten. I will never trust her with a pot again. But I

48
00:04:47,394 --> 00:04:52,579
told her, I forgive you. And I felt a weight fall off my shoulders.

49
00:04:53,730 --> 00:04:59,079
Bénédicte didn't lose her year. She's in ninth grade now, top of her

50
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:04,350
class in science. She still says she'll be a doctor. I believe her.

51
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:11,880
I'm telling you this because betrayal happens to everyone. A sister, a friend, a

52
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:18,899
husband, a boss. And the devil always comes with two offers. Revenge, or discouragement.

53
00:05:19,449 --> 00:05:24,462
Have you ever been betrayed by someone you trusted? How did God

54
00:05:24,462 --> 00:05:29,156
lift you up? Write it in the comments. And share this video

55
00:05:29,156 --> 00:05:33,929
on WhatsApp with a sister who needs it today. God bless you.

56
00:05:36,684 --> 00:05:40,002
If you're living through a betrayal like this, don't stay alone.

57
00:05:40,602 --> 00:05:45,272
Open the Community Covenant app. The link is in the description.

58
00:05:45,872 --> 00:05:51,920
Tap "Ask for Help" and write how you're really doing. Whatever is on your heart.

59
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:56,986
That same day, someone from the team answers you and prays for you.

60
00:05:56,986 --> 00:06:01,586
And tap "Listen" to hear God's Word for the day you're going through.

61
00:06:02,186 --> 00:06:05,041
It's free. God bless you.
